    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "In animal studies, brimonidine tartrate has been shown to cross the blood-brain barrier and is excreted into breast milk after oral administration to lactating rats (see Data) .",
